  "published": "2025-07-02T18:37:03.233Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Dictionary support is now fully functional\n\nFlow hooks can now be awaited, before they could be async, but were a \"fire and forget\" kind of async. now they can optionally be awaited by specifying it in the attribute as a named paramter \"IsAwaited\". that parameter is only used if the flow hook method returns \"async Task\"\n\nEnums are now a first class feature in WinterForge!\nbefore it was something like\nYourEnumType : 0 {\n    value__ = 0;\n}\nfoo = _ref(0);\n\nbut now, its as simle as:\nfoo = YourEnumType.Bar;\n\nHOTIX: Enums flagged with [Flags] are now also supported under the syntax\nfoo = Bar.Fass | Xata | Lohk;",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
